<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n102203" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τακ-τικός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ή</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>fit for ordering</i>, or <i>arranging</i>, esp. in
			war, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τ. ἀνήρ</span>
			<i>tactician</i>, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Cyr.</u>
				8.5.15
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τακτικὸν ἡγεῖσθαί τι</span> to
			think it <i>a good piece of tactics</i>, ibid.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἱ τ. ἀριθμοί</span> the <i>regular</i>
			battalions, ib.<i><span class="en">
				3.3.11
			</span></i>: <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ τακτική</span> (sc. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τέχνη</span>) <i>the art of tactics</i>,
				<i><span class="en">
				Nicom.Com.
				1.37
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ τ</span>. <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Cyr.</u>
				1.6.14
			</span></i>, etc.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τ. ὑπόμνημα</span>
			Aen.Tact.tit. (interpol.); <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τακτικόν</span>, title of work by <i><span class="en">
				Democr.
			</span></i>(<i><span class="en">
				<u>Fr.</u>
				28b
			</span></i>). Adv.
			
				Comp.
			
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ώτερον</span>
			
				v.l. for
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τατικ-</span>
			 in Sch.<i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Ph.</u>
				1141
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> generally,
				<i>regulating</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δογμάτων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					M.Ant.
					1.9
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>ordinal</i>, of numbers, <i><span class="en">
				D.T.
				636.14
			</span></i>.</div>
